From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] sapi: the eSpeak NG voice is Stained Glass Voice (eSpeak NG)

The voice token showed as "Wine Default Voice" with Female and Wine attributes. Its name (the
default and 409 values, the Name attribute) is now "Stained Glass Voice (eSpeak NG)", vendor
eSpeak NG, gender Male as eSpeak NG's default voice is; the token's key, and so its ID, stays
as it was because programs may have stored it.
---
diff --git a/dlls/sapi/sapi.rgs b/dlls/sapi/sapi.rgs
index 2e8cdc6..cf211a3 100644
--- a/dlls/sapi/sapi.rgs
+++ b/dlls/sapi/sapi.rgs
@@ -35,16 +35,16 @@ HKLM
                     {
                         NoRemove 'Wine Default Voice'
                         {
-                            val '' = s 'Wine Default Voice'
-                            val '409' = s 'Wine Default Voice'
+                            val '' = s 'Stained Glass Voice (eSpeak NG)'
+                            val '409' = s 'Stained Glass Voice (eSpeak NG)'
                             val CLSID = s '{C64501F6-E6E6-451F-A150-25D0839BC510}'
                             NoRemove Attributes
                             {
                                 val Language = s '409'
-                                val Gender = s 'Female'
+                                val Gender = s 'Male'
                                 val Age = s 'Adult'
-                                val Name = s 'Wine Default Voice'
-                                val Vendor = s 'Wine'
+                                val Name = s 'Stained Glass Voice (eSpeak NG)'
+                                val Vendor = s 'eSpeak NG'
                             }
                         }
                     }
